# Drawing standard

Follow `docs/drawing-standard.md`.

- Line weights are millimetres on paper: cut walls 0.50, visible edges 0.25, dimensions and hatches 0.13.
- At 1:50, a 10.00 m wall is 200 mm on the sheet. Do not scale by screen pixels.
- Dimension text is centimetres by default (`420`, not `4.20 m`). Areas are `m²` with one decimal on the tag.
- Wall fill is solid poche from the join polygons, with openings cut out. Do not stroke centerlines as the finished wall.
- Title block fields come from the plan and the saved defaults. Do not hard-code the owner's name.

```text
# Bad: strokeWidth = 3  (screen pixels)
# Good: strokeMm = 0.50, then mm * (pagePx / paperMm)
```
